00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:28,300
我就觉得对这个社交
wǒ jiù jué de duì zhè gè shè jiāo
I just feel like when it comes to socializing,

369
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:32,166
可能现在应该有越来越多人不想社交
kě néng xiàn zài yīng gāi yǒu yuè lái yuè duō rén bù xiǎng shè jiāo
maybe more and more people nowadays don’t want to socialize.

370
00:14:32,166 --> 00:14:33,166
我不知道你
wǒ bù zhī dào nǐ
I don’t know about you—

371
00:14:33,166 --> 00:14:34,600
你住在中国嘛
nǐ zhù zài zhōng guó ma
you live in China—

372
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,900
你的感觉呢
nǐ de gǎn jué ne
what’s your feeling about it?

373
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:38,000
是不是大家都不太喜欢
shì bú shì dà jiā dōu bú tài xǐ huān
Don’t people kind of dislike…

374
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,366
没有意义的社交
méi yǒu yì yì de shè jiāo
meaningless social interaction?

375
00:14:39,366 --> 00:14:40,766
对是的
duì shì de
Yes, exactly.

376
00:14:40,766 --> 00:14:41,833
没有意义的社交
méi yǒu yì yì de shè jiāo
Socializing without meaning—

377
00:14:41,833 --> 00:14:44,500
不会浪费很多我的时间
bú huì làng fèi hěn duō wǒ de shí jiān
I won’t waste too much of my time on that.

378
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:45,700
我的时间很宝贵
wǒ de shí jiān hěn bǎo guì
My time is very precious.

379
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:48,733
然后大家就觉得我自己的时间很宝贵
rán hòu dà jiā jiù jué de wǒ zì jǐ de shí jiān hěn bǎo guì
And everyone feels their time is precious too.

380
00:14:48,733 --> 00:14:49,566
然后我不想
rán hòu wǒ bù xiǎng
And I don’t want to—

381
00:14:49,566 --> 00:14:52,800
我不想花在就是没有用的人
wǒ bù xiǎng huā zài jiù shì méi yǒu yòng de rén
I don’t want to spend it on people who don’t matter,

382
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:55,100
或者是没有意义的事情上面
huò zhě shì méi yǒu yì yì de shì qíng shàng miàn
or on meaningless things.

383
00:14:55,100 --> 00:14:58,000
嗯很好
ń hěn hǎo
Mhm, that’s great.

384
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:01,166
那我们来说一下第三个
nà wǒ men lái shuō yí xià dì sān gè
Let’s now talk about the third one.

385
00:15:01,166 --> 00:15:04,700
第三个我觉得很很中国
dì sān gè wǒ jué de hěn hěn zhōng guó
The third one, I think, is very, very Chinese.

386
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:07,333
我不知道是不是很亚洲
wǒ bù zhī dào shì bú shì hěn yà zhōu
I don’t know if it’s common across Asia too.

387
00:15:07,333 --> 00:15:10,200
就是聚餐文化
jiù shì jù cān wén huà
It’s the group dining culture.

388
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,333
就是我们做什么
jiù shì wǒ men zuò shén me
Like whatever we do,

389
00:15:12,333 --> 00:15:13,833
都是出去吃个饭
dōu shì chū qù chī gè fàn
it always ends up with going out to eat.

390
00:15:13,833 --> 00:15:14,500
对不对对
duì bú duì duì
Right?

391
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:16,233
你是不是很有经验
nǐ shì bú shì hěn yǒu jīng yàn
You’ve got a lot of experience with this, right?

392
00:15:16,233 --> 00:15:18,733
对我以前在公司上班的时候
duì wǒ yǐ qián zài gōng sī shàng bān de shí hòu
Yes, when I used to work at a company,

393
00:15:18,733 --> 00:15:22,333
就是经常会和同事一起出去吃饭
jiù shì jīng cháng huì hé tóng shì yì qǐ chū qù chī fàn
we would often go out to eat with coworkers.

394
00:15:22,333 --> 00:15:24,000
对经常聚餐
duì jīng cháng jù cān
Yes, group meals were frequent.

395
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,533
然后公司呢
rán hòu gōng sī ne
And the company…

396
00:15:25,533 --> 00:15:27,233
也会组织团建
yě huì zǔ zhī tuán jiàn
would also organize team building.

397
00:15:27,233 --> 00:15:29,400
团建呢就是团队的建设
tuán jiàn ne jiù shì tuán duì de jiàn shè
Team building means building team cohesion.

398
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:30,133
其实目的呢
qí shí mù dì ne
The goal actually is—

399
00:15:30,133 --> 00:15:31,533
就是我们做一些活动啊
jiù shì wǒ men zuò yì xiē huó dòng a
we do some activities,

400
00:15:31,533 --> 00:15:32,433
我们去吃饭啊
wǒ men qù chī fàn a
go eat together,

401
00:15:32,433 --> 00:15:34,566
然后让我们的关系更近啊
rán hòu ràng wǒ men de guān xì gèng jìn a
and it makes our relationships closer.

402
00:15:34,566 --> 00:15:37,300
我们的这个连接更紧啊
wǒ men de zhè gè lián jiē gèng jǐn a
Our connection becomes stronger.

403
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:38,533
这样子对
zhè yàng zi duì
That kind of thing, yes.

404
00:15:38,533 --> 00:15:39,600
经常会去吃饭
jīng cháng huì qù chī fàn
So we’d often go eat together.

405
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,600
对
duì
Yes.

406
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,800
还有中国人谈生意
hái yǒu zhōng guó rén tán shēng yì
Also, when Chinese people talk business,

407
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:45,366
是不是经常要出去喝酒
shì bú shì jīng cháng yào chū qù hē jiǔ
don’t they often have to go out drinking?

408
00:15:45,366 --> 00:15:46,233
出去吃饭
chū qù chī fàn
And go out for meals?

409
00:15:46,233 --> 00:15:48,200
对
duì
Yes.

410
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,533
啊
a
Ah…

411
00:15:49,533 --> 00:15:50,933
简直就是我的噩梦
jiǎn zhí jiù shì wǒ de è mèng
It’s honestly my nightmare.

412
00:15:50,933 --> 00:15:52,233
喝酒
hē jiǔ
Drinking alcohol.

413
00:15:52,233 --> 00:15:53,800
对中国人一定要喝
duì zhōng guó rén yí dìng yào hē
Yeah, Chinese people must drink.

414
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,300
你也有
nǐ yě yǒu
You’ve had that too?

415
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:56,600
有啊
yǒu a
Yeah.

416
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:58,600
你有啊
nǐ yǒu a
You have?

417
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,200
要因为
yào yīn wèi
Yeah, because—

418
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,766
而且我在山东
ér qiě wǒ zài shān dōng
And I’m in Shandong.

419
00:16:00,766 --> 00:16:03,000
山东在中国就是很有名的
shān dōng zài zhōng guó jiù shì hěn yǒu míng de
Shandong is really famous in China—

420
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,766
就是大家都很有名
jiù shì dà jiā dōu hěn yǒu míng
Like, everyone’s known for it.

421
00:16:04,766 --> 00:16:07,600
喝酒的省哈哈哈
hē jiǔ de shěng hā hā hā
It’s the drinking province. Hahaha.

422
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,633
对就是
duì jiù shì
Yeah, exactly—

423
00:16:08,633 --> 00:16:09,500
只要出去吃饭
zhǐ yào chū qù chī fàn
As long as you’re eating out,

424
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,433
我肯定会喝酒
wǒ kěn dìng huì hē jiǔ
I’ll definitely have to drink.

425
00:16:11,433 --> 00:16:13,533
但是我又很不喜欢喝酒
dàn shì wǒ yòu hěn bù xǐ huān hē jiǔ
But I really don’t like drinking.

426
00:16:13,533 --> 00:16:15,333
我的酒量不好
wǒ de jiǔ liàng bù hǎo
I can’t hold my liquor.

427
00:16:15,333 --> 00:16:18,600
但是你不能不喝酒
dàn shì nǐ bù néng bù hē jiǔ
But you can’t not drink.

428
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:21,800
除非你有一定不能喝酒的理由
chú fēi nǐ yǒu yí dìng bù néng hē jiǔ de lǐ yóu
Unless you have a solid reason not to drink.

429
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:24,833
不然的话还是会让你喝酒的
bù rán de huà hái shì huì ràng nǐ hē jiǔ de
Otherwise, they’ll still try to get you to drink.

430
00:16:24,833 --> 00:16:28,833
什么是一定不能喝酒的理由
shén me shì yí dìng bù néng hē jiǔ de lǐ yóu
So what’s a reason that definitely works to avoid drinking?

431
00:16:28,833 --> 00:16:30,933
比如你可以说
bǐ rú nǐ kě yǐ shuō
For example, you can say,

432
00:16:30,933 --> 00:16:32,133
我怀孕了
wǒ huái yùn le
“I’m pregnant.”

433
00:16:32,133 --> 00:16:33,933
那肯定不能喝酒
nà kěn dìng bù néng hē jiǔ
Then of course you can’t drink.

434
00:16:33,933 --> 00:16:35,200
或者呢你可以说
huò zhě ne nǐ kě yǐ shuō
Or you can say,

435
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,366
我在备孕
wǒ zài bèi yùn
“I’m preparing to get pregnant.”

436
00:16:36,366 --> 00:16:37,800
我想要生孩子
wǒ xiǎng yào shēng hái zi
“I want to have a baby.”

437
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,433
我想要怀孕
wǒ xiǎng yào huái yùn
“I want to get pregnant.”

438
00:16:39,433 --> 00:16:41,700
所以我不可以喝酒
suǒ yǐ wǒ bù kě yǐ hē jiǔ
So I can’t drink alcohol.

439
00:16:41,700 --> 00:16:43,900
或者啊你可以说
huò zhě a nǐ kě yǐ shuō
Or you can say,

440
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:45,033
你吃了药
nǐ chī le yào
“I took medicine.”

441
00:16:45,033 --> 00:16:46,000
嗯有
ń yǒu
Mm, yeah—

442
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,166
在中国有个药叫头孢
zài zhōng guó yǒu gè yào jiào tóu bāo
There’s a medicine in China called cephalosporin.

443
00:16:48,166 --> 00:16:49,766
如果你喝吃了这个药
rú guǒ nǐ chī le zhè gè yào
If you’ve taken that medicine,

444
00:16:49,766 --> 00:16:50,966
然后你再喝酒的话
rán hòu nǐ zài hē jiǔ de huà
and then drink alcohol,

445
00:16:50,966 --> 00:16:52,700
会死的
huì sǐ de
you could die.

446
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:54,966
所以你可以说啊
suǒ yǐ nǐ kě yǐ shuō a
So you can say,

447
00:16:54,966 --> 00:16:55,966
我吃了头孢
wǒ chī le tóu bāo
“I took cephalosporin.”

448
00:16:55,966 --> 00:16:58,200
我不能喝酒
wǒ bù néng hē jiǔ
“I can’t drink.”

449
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,200
对
duì
Exactly.

450
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:01,000
以前人们会说
yǐ qián rén men huì shuō
In the past, people would say,

451
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,133
我开车了
wǒ kāi chē le
“I’m driving.”

452
00:17:02,133 --> 00:17:03,333
我不能喝酒
wǒ bù néng hē jiǔ
“I can’t drink.”

453
00:17:03,333 --> 00:17:05,433
但是现在这个理由已经不行了
dàn shì xiàn zài zhè gè lǐ yóu yǐ jīng bù xíng le
But now that excuse doesn’t work anymore.

454
00:17:05,433 --> 00:17:07,766
因为现在有代驾啊
yīn wèi xiàn zài yǒu dài jià a
Because now there’s designated driver services.

455
00:17:07,766 --> 00:17:09,600
有代驾然后你说我
yǒu dài jià rán hòu nǐ shuō wǒ
There’s a designated driver, and if you say,

456
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:10,900
我开车了
wǒ kāi chē le
“I’m driving,”

457
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:12,033
他说没关系啊
tā shuō méi guān xì a
they’ll say, “No problem!”

458
00:17:12,033 --> 00:17:14,166
你可以打电话叫一个代驾
nǐ kě yǐ dǎ diàn huà jiào yí gè dài jià
“You can call a driver service.”

459
00:17:14,166 --> 00:17:16,366
就是找一个人过来开你的车
jiù shì zhǎo yí gè rén guò lái kāi nǐ de chē
They’ll send someone to drive your car for you.

460
00:17:16,366 --> 00:17:18,133
把你送回去
bǎ nǐ sòng huí qù
And take you back home.

461
00:17:18,133 --> 00:17:21,900
所以这个理由已经不行了
suǒ yǐ zhè gè lǐ yóu yǐ jīng bù xíng le
So that excuse doesn’t work anymore.

462
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:25,533
不知道原来中国人还是这么爱喝酒
bù zhī dào yuán lái zhōng guó rén hái shì zhè me ài hē jiǔ
I didn’t realize Chinese people still love drinking so much.

463
00:17:25,533 --> 00:17:29,133
因为我没有这些社交的机会
yīn wèi wǒ méi yǒu zhè xiē shè jiāo de jī huì
Because I don’t really have those social opportunities.

464
00:17:29,133 --> 00:17:32,933
那我可能太不合群了
nà wǒ kě néng tài bù hé qún le
Maybe I’m just too socially incompatible.

465
00:17:32,933 --> 00:17:33,366
哈哈就是
hā hā jiù shì
Haha, it’s just—

466
00:17:33,366 --> 00:17:34,233
我不想喝
wǒ bù xiǎng hē
I don’t want to drink.

467
00:17:34,233 --> 00:17:35,566
就是不想喝
jiù shì bù xiǎng hē
I simply don’t want to.

468
00:17:35,566 --> 00:17:37,566
no means no你想干嘛
no means no nǐ xiǎng gàn ma
No means no, what more do you want?

469
00:17:37,566 --> 00:17:38,900
我不喝哈哈
wǒ bù hē hā hā
I’m not drinking, haha.

470
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:41,400
那我可能下次就不会被邀请
nà wǒ kě néng xià cì jiù bú huì bèi yāo qǐng
Maybe next time I won’t be invited anymore.

471
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:41,833
对
duì
Right.

472
00:17:41,833 --> 00:17:45,333
而且你可能如果你会参加这样的聚会
ér qiě nǐ kě néng rú guǒ nǐ huì cān jiā zhè yàng de jù huì
Also, if you do attend these kinds of gatherings,

473
00:17:45,333 --> 00:17:49,333
或者去和一些人吃饭的话
huò zhě qù hé yì xiē rén chī fàn de huà
or go eat with some people,

474
00:17:49,333 --> 00:17:54,200
他们会说一些让你很难拒绝的理由
tā men huì shuō yì xiē ràng nǐ hěn nán jù jué de lǐ yóu
they’ll say things that are hard for you to refuse.

475
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,800
比如
bǐ rú
For example—

476
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,000
你来中国了
nǐ lái zhōng guó le
“You came to China!”

477
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:57,833
然后呢哎呀
rán hòu ne āi yā
And then, “Oh no…”

478
00:17:57,833 --> 00:17:59,700
我这个我太忙了
wǒ zhè gè wǒ tài máng le
“I’ve been so busy.”

479
00:17:59,700 --> 00:18:02,033
我也没有好好的招待你
wǒ yě méi yǒu hǎo hǎo de zhāo dài nǐ
“I didn’t get to treat you well.”

480
00:18:02,033 --> 00:18:04,166
要不我敬你一杯酒吧
yào bù wǒ jìng nǐ yì bēi jiǔ ba
“How about I toast you a drink?”

481
00:18:04,166 --> 00:18:05,233
我敬你一杯酒
wǒ jìng nǐ yì bēi jiǔ
“I’ll drink this one for you.”

482
00:18:05,233 --> 00:18:06,500
然后表达一下
rán hòu biǎo dá yí xià
“To express…”

483
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:08,700
我这个很不好意思
wǒ zhè gè hěn bù hǎo yì si
“I feel really sorry.”

484
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:10,000
那你说你喝不喝
nà nǐ shuō nǐ hē bù hē
Now, do you drink or not?

485
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,400
人家都跟你说对不起了
rén jiā dōu gēn nǐ shuō duì bù qǐ le
They already apologized to you.

486
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,300
不好意思了
bù hǎo yì si le
They’ve shown their sincerity.

487
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:12,800
你说不喝
nǐ shuō bù hē
And you say “I won’t drink”?

488
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,733
我不喝我不接受你的道歉
wǒ bù hē wǒ bù jiē shòu nǐ de dào qiàn
“I’m not drinking, I don’t accept your apology”?

489
00:18:14,733 --> 00:18:15,966
好像也很奇怪
hǎo xiàng yě hěn qí guài
That also feels kind of weird.

490
00:18:15,966 --> 00:18:17,833
对不对
duì bù duì
Right?

491
00:18:17,833 --> 00:18:22,166
就是他会说一些很难拒绝的理由
jiù shì tā huì shuō yì xiē hěn nán jù jué de lǐ yóu
They’ll say things that are really hard to refuse.

492
00:18:22,166 --> 00:18:24,733
我觉得这个没有非常难
wǒ jué de zhè gè méi yǒu fēi cháng nán
I don’t think it’s that hard, honestly.

493
00:18:24,733 --> 00:18:25,633
我就说哦
wǒ jiù shuō ò
I just say, “Oh…”

494
00:18:25,633 --> 00:18:27,933
没关系你不用道歉
méi guān xì nǐ bú yòng dào qiàn
“No worries, you don’t need to apologize.”

495
00:18:27,933 --> 00:18:29,833
或者我接受你的歉意
huò zhě wǒ jiē shòu nǐ de qiàn yì
Or, “I accept your apology.”

496
00:18:29,833 --> 00:18:32,733
但是我不喝酒哈哈
dàn shì wǒ bù hē jiǔ hā hā
“But I don’t drink, haha.”

497
00:18:32,733 --> 00:18:35,833
可能这就是你最后一次来这吃饭了
kě néng zhè jiù shì nǐ zuì hòu yí cì lái zhè chī fàn le
Maybe that’ll be the last time you’re invited to eat here.

498
00:18:35,833 --> 00:18:38,133
再也没有然后了
zài yě méi yǒu rán hòu le
There won’t be a next time.

499
00:18:38,133 --> 00:18:41,700
对我特别喜欢做这种不合群的事情
duì wǒ tè bié xǐ huān zuò zhè zhǒng bù hé qún de shì qíng
Yes, I actually love doing these kinds of “nonconformist” things.

500
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:42,533
好
hǎo
Okay.

501
00:18:42,533 --> 00:18:43,133
对
duì
Yeah.

502
00:18:43,133 --> 00:18:45,800
所以大家知道为什么我不住在中国
suǒ yǐ dà jiā zhī dào wèi shén me wǒ bú zhù zài zhōng guó
So now you all know why I don’t live in China.

503
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:46,766
对你看
duì nǐ kàn
Right, you see—

504
00:18:46,766 --> 00:18:49,033
在中国你没有朋友吧
zài zhōng guó nǐ méi yǒu péng yǒu ba
You don’t have friends in China, do you?

505
00:18:49,033 --> 00:18:51,600
只有我没有朋友
zhǐ yǒu wǒ méi yǒu péng yǒu
Only I don’t have any friends.

506
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,533
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha.

507
00:18:52,533 --> 00:18:53,933
好最后一个
hǎo zuì hòu yí gè
Alright, last one.

508
00:18:53,933 --> 00:18:55,100
Weixuan
Weixuan
Weixuan.

509
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:55,700
最后一个
zuì hòu yí gè
The final one.

510
00:18:55,700 --> 00:18:58,100
我们来说一说面子吧
wǒ men lái shuō yì shuō miàn zi ba
Let’s talk about “face” (social reputation).

511
00:18:58,100 --> 00:19:00,933
嗯中国的面子文化
ń zhōng guó de miàn zi wén huà
Mm, Chinese “face culture.”

512
00:19:00,933 --> 00:19:05,100
包括我们在社交的时候有很多辈分
bāo kuò wǒ men zài shè jiāo de shí hòu yǒu hěn duō bèi fèn
It also includes things like seniority when socializing.

513
00:19:05,100 --> 00:19:06,233
对不对对啊
duì bú duì duì a
Right?

514
00:19:06,233 --> 00:19:07,533
你是长辈
nǐ shì zhǎng bèi
You’re an elder,

515
00:19:07,533 --> 00:19:09,533
就是你是年纪比较大的
jiù shì nǐ shì nián jì bǐ jiào dà de
meaning you’re older in age.

516
00:19:09,533 --> 00:19:12,533
对你是晚辈小辈
duì nǐ shì wǎn bèi xiǎo bèi
Yes, or you’re a junior, someone younger.

517
00:19:12,533 --> 00:19:13,766
就是年轻的
jiù shì nián qīng de
Like the younger generation.

518
00:19:13,766 --> 00:19:14,700
对
duì
Right.

519
00:19:14,700 --> 00:19:16,233
还有就是你是领导啊
hái yǒu jiù shì nǐ shì lǐng dǎo a
Also, if you’re a leader or boss—

520
00:19:16,233 --> 00:19:17,800
你在工作的时候
nǐ zài gōng zuò de shí hòu
in a work setting,

521
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:19,200
你在公司
nǐ zài gōng sī
if you’re in a company,

522
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,900
你的工作
nǐ de gōng zuò
your job,

523
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:22,500
你是我的领导
nǐ shì wǒ de lǐng dǎo
you are my boss.

524
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:25,366
老板还有我是你的下属
lǎo bǎn hái yǒu wǒ shì nǐ de xià shǔ
Boss, and I’m your subordinate.

525
00:19:25,366 --> 00:19:28,800
我们有很多这些位分和面子
wǒ men yǒu hěn duō zhè xiē wèi fèn hé miàn zi
We have a lot of these roles and “face” dynamics.

526
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:31,633
你之前在公司工作
nǐ zhī qián zài gōng sī gōng zuò
When you worked in a company before,

527
00:19:31,633 --> 00:19:34,700
也有很多这样的位分吗
yě yǒu hěn duō zhè yàng de wèi fèn ma
did you also see a lot of these roles and ranks?

528
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:35,766
有
yǒu
Yes.

529
00:19:35,766 --> 00:19:38,533
如果这个人是你的领导
rú guǒ zhè gè rén shì nǐ de lǐng dǎo
If someone is your boss,

530
00:19:38,533 --> 00:19:41,166
那你肯定要听你的领导的
nà nǐ kěn dìng yào tīng nǐ de lǐng dǎo de
you definitely have to listen to them.

531
00:19:41,166 --> 00:19:44,500
当然有的时候可能他说的不是很对
dāng rán yǒu de shí hòu kě néng tā shuō de bú shì hěn duì
Of course, sometimes what they say might not be right.

532
00:19:44,500 --> 00:19:48,033
但是你不可以说你说得不对我说得对
dàn shì nǐ bù kě yǐ shuō nǐ shuō de bú duì wǒ shuō de duì
But you can’t say, “You’re wrong and I’m right.”

533
00:19:48,033 --> 00:19:49,333
那肯定不行
nà kěn dìng bù xíng
That’s definitely not okay.

534
00:19:49,333 --> 00:19:52,533
领导说什么你就做什么就是了
lǐng dǎo shuō shén me nǐ jiù zuò shén me jiù shì le
Whatever the boss says, you just do it.

535
00:19:52,533 --> 00:19:53,500
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha.

536
00:19:53,500 --> 00:19:55,366
你不可以说这个不好
nǐ bù kě yǐ shuō zhè gè bù hǎo
You can’t say, “This isn’t good.”

537
00:19:55,366 --> 00:19:56,300
你可以说
nǐ kě yǐ shuō
You can say,

538
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:57,966
或者这样怎么样
huò zhě zhè yàng zěn me yàng
“How about doing it this way instead?”

539
00:19:57,966 --> 00:20:01,533
你要说的让别人可以接受
nǐ yào shuō de ràng bié rén kě yǐ jiē shòu
You need to say it in a way others can accept.

540
00:20:01,533 --> 00:20:02,733
不能说的太直接
bù néng shuō de tài zhí jiē
You can’t be too direct.

541
00:20:02,733 --> 00:20:05,000
就是你要照顾别人的面子
jiù shì nǐ yào zhào gù bié rén de miàn zi
You have to take care of the other person’s face.

542
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,600
你不可以当别人的面
nǐ bù kě yǐ dāng bié rén de miàn
You can’t do it right in front of someone.

543
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:10,100
然后打你领导的面子
rán hòu dǎ nǐ lǐng dǎo de miàn zi
And embarrass your leader in front of others.

544
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:11,500
那真的不好
nà zhēn de bù hǎo
That’s really not okay.

545
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:13,166
对明白
duì míng bái
Yes, got it.

546
00:20:13,166 --> 00:20:14,800
对对对
duì duì duì
Yeah, exactly.

547
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:16,366
好
hǎo
Okay.

548
00:20:16,366 --> 00:20:22,533
那你们会做一些事情让领导有面子吗
nà nǐ men huì zuò yì xiē shì qíng ràng lǐng dǎo yǒu miàn zi ma
So would you do things just to give your boss “face”?

549
00:20:22,533 --> 00:20:24,533
我好像不会
wǒ hǎo xiàng bú huì
I don’t think I would.

550
00:20:24,533 --> 00:20:27,533
但是我有同事会
dàn shì wǒ yǒu tóng shì huì
But some of my coworkers would.

551
00:20:27,533 --> 00:20:30,533
就是他会做一些不是他工作的事情
jiù shì tā huì zuò yì xiē bú shì tā gōng zuò de shì qíng
They’d do things that aren’t part of their job.

552
00:20:30,533 --> 00:20:34,400
比如他会去给他的领导拿包
bǐ rú tā huì qù gěi tā de lǐng dǎo ná bāo
Like carrying their boss’s bag.

553
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:36,900
然后他领导上车
rán hòu tā lǐng dǎo shàng chē
When the boss gets in the car,

554
00:20:36,900 --> 00:20:39,233
他给他的领导开车门
tā gěi tā de lǐng dǎo kāi chē mén
they open the car door for them.

555
00:20:39,233 --> 00:20:40,700
然后这种事情对我来说
rán hòu zhè zhǒng shì qíng duì wǒ lái shuō
And things like that, to me,

556
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:42,766
我可能这辈子我都不会做
wǒ kě néng zhè bèi zi wǒ dōu bú huì zuò
I probably wouldn’t do them in my whole life.

557
00:20:42,766 --> 00:20:45,600
我不能接受这个不是我的工作
wǒ bù néng jiē shòu zhè gè bú shì wǒ de gōng zuò
I can’t accept it — that’s not my job.

558
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:48,300
但是很多人他会觉得
dàn shì hěn duō rén tā huì jué de
But a lot of people feel that

559
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:49,500
这个是我拉近
zhè gè shì wǒ lā jìn
this is how they can get closer

560
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:52,800
我和我领导关系的一个很好的办法
wǒ hé wǒ lǐng dǎo guān xì de yí gè hěn hǎo de bàn fǎ
to their boss — a good way to build that relationship.

561
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:54,100
然后领导会觉得
rán hòu lǐng dǎo huì jué de
And then the boss will think,

562
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:55,900
这个人很懂事啊
zhè gè rén hěn dǒng shì a
“This person is very sensible.”

563
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:57,333
他很尊敬我
tā hěn zūn jìng wǒ
“He respects me.”

564
00:20:57,333 --> 00:20:59,233
对然后领导很会觉得
duì rán hòu lǐng dǎo huì jué de
Yes, and then the boss might think,

565
00:20:59,233 --> 00:21:00,800
这个人还不错
zhè gè rén hái bú cuò
“This person is pretty good.”

566
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,800
但是我我不行
dàn shì wǒ wǒ bù xíng
But me, I can’t do that.

567
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:03,233
我做不到
wǒ zuò bù dào
I just can’t.

568
00:21:03,233 --> 00:21:06,633
完了
wán le
That’s it.

569
00:21:06,633 --> 00:21:07,700
我一听到这个
wǒ yì tīng dào zhè gè
As soon as I hear this,

570
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:10,500
我觉得我太不适合在中国的公司了
wǒ jué de wǒ tài bú shì hé zài zhōng guó de gōng sī le
I feel like I’m really not suited to work at a Chinese company.

571
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:12,766
我肯定马上被开除
wǒ kěn dìng mǎ shàng bèi kāi chú
I’d definitely get fired right away.

572
00:21:12,766 --> 00:21:13,400
我不能接受
wǒ bù néng jiē shòu
I can’t accept it.

573
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:16,033
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha.

574
00:21:16,033 --> 00:21:16,800
就是那个跟老板说
jiù shì nà gè gēn lǎo bǎn shuō
Like, the one who tells the boss,

575
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,000
你做错了
nǐ zuò cuò le
“You did it wrong,”

576
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:18,300
我做的是对的
wǒ zuò de shì duì de
“I did it right.”

577
00:21:18,300 --> 00:21:21,633
然后说不去帮老板开门
rán hòu shuō bú qù bāng lǎo bǎn kāi mén
And refuses to help the boss open the door.

578
00:21:21,633 --> 00:21:24,600
对不去帮他拿包的那个人就是我
duì bú qù bāng tā ná bāo de nà gè rén jiù shì wǒ
Yes, the one who won’t carry his bag — that’s me.

579
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:27,333
那肯定是第一个走
nà kěn dìng shì dì yī gè zǒu
Definitely the first one to be let go.

580
00:21:27,333 --> 00:21:28,600
对就是
duì jiù shì
Yeah, exactly—

581
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:30,900
在中国就是文化里面
zài zhōng guó jiù shì wén huà lǐ miàn
In Chinese culture,

582
00:21:30,900 --> 00:21:33,600
我们有的时候会说这个人他不懂事
wǒ men yǒu de shí hòu huì shuō zhè gè rén tā bù dǒng shì
we sometimes say, “This person doesn’t know how to behave.”

583
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:34,633
会说
huì shuō
People will say,

584
00:21:34,633 --> 00:21:36,600
领导吃饭懂事
lǐng dǎo chī fàn dǒng shì
“You need to be sensible when eating with the boss.”

585
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:39,000
对领导吃饭你转桌
duì lǐng dǎo chī fàn nǐ zhuǎn zhuō
Right, when dining with the boss and turning the table.

586
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,400
领导要夹菜了
lǐng dǎo yào jiā cài le
If the boss is about to pick up a dish,

587
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:42,933
然后你把菜转走了
rán hòu nǐ bǎ cài zhuǎn zǒu le
and you rotate the dish away from him—

588
00:21:42,933 --> 00:21:45,700
或者呢领导开车门
huò zhě ne lǐng dǎo kāi chē mén
Or say, the boss opens the car door…

589
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:47,100
你上车
nǐ shàng chē
and you get in.

590
00:21:47,100 --> 00:21:49,366
领导开车门是要自己上车的
lǐng dǎo kāi chē mén shì yào zì jǐ shàng chē de
If the boss opens the door, it’s for themselves to get in.

591
00:21:49,366 --> 00:21:51,500
然后你上车了
rán hòu nǐ shàng chē le
But you got in instead.

592
00:21:51,500 --> 00:21:53,333
你觉得领导会喜欢你吗
nǐ jué de lǐng dǎo huì xǐ huān nǐ ma
Do you think the boss will like that?

593
00:21:53,333 --> 00:21:55,400
哈哈哈哈哈哈
hā hā hā hā hā hā
Hahahahahaha.

594
00:21:55,400 --> 00:21:56,700
那我就是那种人
nà wǒ jiù shì nà zhǒng rén
Then I’m exactly that kind of person.

595
00:21:56,700 --> 00:21:59,733
就是领导说什么我都就是听话听音
jiù shì lǐng dǎo shuō shén me wǒ dōu jiù shì tīng huà tīng yīn
Whatever the boss says, I just try to "read between the lines."

596
00:21:59,733 --> 00:22:02,100
我永远都听不懂领导在说什么
wǒ yǒng yuǎn dōu tīng bù dǒng lǐng dǎo zài shuō shén me
But I never actually understand what the boss is saying.

597
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:03,900
我觉得他就是这个意思
wǒ jué de tā jiù shì zhè gè yì si
I think he means it literally.

598
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:04,966
他说那你做吧
tā shuō nà nǐ zuò ba
He says, “Then go ahead and do it,”

599
00:22:04,966 --> 00:22:06,933
我说好那他就是让我做吧
wǒ shuō hǎo nà tā jiù shì ràng wǒ zuò ba
and I say, “Okay,” thinking he really means I should do it.

600
00:22:06,933 --> 00:22:09,733
其实他的意思是说我看你能做的了吗
qí shí tā de yì si shì shuō wǒ kàn nǐ néng zuò de liǎo ma
But what he actually means is, “Let me see if you can handle it.”

601
00:22:09,733 --> 00:22:10,766
是这个意思
shì zhè gè yì si
That’s what he meant.

602
00:22:10,766 --> 00:22:12,333
但是我听不懂
dàn shì wǒ tīng bù dǒng
But I didn’t get it.

603
00:22:12,333 --> 00:22:13,166
哦
ó
Oh.

604
00:22:13,166 --> 00:22:14,900
对就很累明白
duì jiù hěn lèi míng bái
Yeah, it’s really tiring — I get it now.

605
00:22:14,900 --> 00:22:16,300
嗯
ń
Mhm.

606
00:22:16,300 --> 00:22:17,733
对太搞笑了
duì tài gǎo xiào le
Yeah, that’s so funny.

607
00:22:17,733 --> 00:22:20,100
刚才那个吃饭转桌
gāng cái nà gè chī fàn zhuǎn zhuō
That part earlier about turning the table during a meal—

608
00:22:20,100 --> 00:22:22,166
因为中国我们有那个圆桌
yīn wèi zhōng guó wǒ men yǒu nà gè yuán zhuō
because in China we have round tables.

609
00:22:22,166 --> 00:22:23,366
对
duì
Right.

610
00:22:23,366 --> 00:22:24,433
老板开门
lǎo bǎn kāi mén
The boss opens the door…

611
00:22:24,433 --> 00:22:26,000
你上车
nǐ shàng chē
and you get in.

612
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,833
感觉挺爽
gǎn jué tǐng shuǎng
Feels pretty cool.

613
00:22:27,833 --> 00:22:28,733
太不懂事了
tài bù dǒng shì le
That’s really inconsiderate.

614
00:22:28,733 --> 00:22:31,400
可能是在这个公司的最后一天
kě néng shì zài zhè gè gōng sī de zuì hòu yì tiān
Might be your last day at that company.

615
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:33,300
哈哈哈对
hā hā hā duì
Hahaha, yep.

616
00:22:33,300 --> 00:22:34,700
哈哈哈
hā hā hā
Hahaha.

617
00:22:34,700 --> 00:22:36,433
好的那今天呢
hǎo de nà jīn tiān ne
Alright, so today,

618
00:22:36,433 --> 00:22:38,800
我跟Weixuan聊了
wǒ gēn Weixuan liáo le
I had a chat with Weixuan

619
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:42,200
中国人社交的四个方面
zhōng guó rén shè jiāo de sì gè fāng miàn
about four aspects of Chinese social culture.

620
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:44,766
第一个呢是关系很重要
dì yī gè ne shì guān xì hěn zhòng yào
First, relationships (connections) are very important.

621
00:22:44,766 --> 00:22:48,400
第二个呢就是要含蓄地拒绝
dì èr gè ne jiù shì yào hán xù de jù jué
Second, you should decline things in an indirect way.

622
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:51,633
第三个是我们的聚餐文化
dì sān gè shì wǒ men de jù cān wén huà
Third is our dining culture.

623
00:22:51,633 --> 00:22:53,800
谈什么事情都可以吃饭
tán shén me shì qíng dōu kě yǐ chī fàn
Everything can be discussed over a meal.

624
00:22:53,800 --> 00:22:56,900
第四个呢就是中国的面子文化
dì sì gè ne jiù shì zhōng guó de miàn zi wén huà
Fourth is China’s culture of “face” — saving and giving face.

625
00:22:56,900 --> 00:23:00,800
你听说过这些社交礼仪吗
nǐ tīng shuō guò zhè xiē shè jiāo lǐ yí ma
Have you heard of these social customs?

626
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:02,500
你感觉怎么样
nǐ gǎn jué zěn me yàng
How do you feel about them?

627
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:05,100
你觉得你可以接受吗
nǐ jué de nǐ kě yǐ jiē shòu ma
Do you think you can accept them?

628
00:23:05,100 --> 00:23:08,100
或者有什么是你喜欢的
huò zhě yǒu shén me shì nǐ xǐ huān de
Or are there some that you actually like?

629
00:23:08,100 --> 00:23:10,600
